sion="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;完整的快速入门请参阅此 &lt;a href="https://fixit.lruihao.cn/documentation/getting-started/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;页面&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>🔧 A clean, elegant but advanced blog theme for Hugo 一个简洁、优雅且高效的 Hugo 主题</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/projects/hugo-fixit/fixit/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Dec 2021 03:35:27 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://lruihao.cn/projects/hugo-fixit/fixit/</guid><category domain="https://lruihao.cn/categories/github/">GitHub</category><description>&lt;!-- markdownlint-disable-file MD033 MD041 --&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src='https://lruihao.cn/images/remote/apple-devices-preview_9761810123432924477.png' alt="Hugo Theme FixIt" height="1158" width="2007"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div align="center" class="ignore"&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;&#10; FixIt is a clean, elegant but advanced blog theme for &lt;a href="https://gohugo.io/"&gt;Hugo&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&#10; &lt;em&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Don't forget to leave a ⭐️ if you like this theme, thanks!&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&#10; &lt;/p&gt;&#10; English |&#10; &lt;a href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hugo-fixit/FixIt/refs/heads/main/README.zh-cn.md"&gt;简体中文&lt;/a&gt; |&#10; &lt;a href="https://fixit.l